recommend keep-going — the next Lindy crux is secp256k1 (the curve that, with RIPEMD-160 + HASH160 + Base58Check/Bech32 and Keccak-256, closes both Bitcoin and Ethereum address derivation in authored Rye); non-gated, agent-doable.
